node_modules/
dist/
.output/
.vite/
/* TanStack Start's build cache (`app/.tanstack/tmp/<uuid>`). Every `vite dev`
   drops a new randomly-named file here, so `git status` showed a fresh
   untracked entry after every run — and a blanket `git add -A` swept five of
   them onto `main` (docs/14, L4 -> L1). They are a cache, not source: the
   tracked route tree is `app/src/routeTree.gen.ts`, which is a different file
   and stays tracked. */
.tanstack/
*.local
*.log
.DS_Store
coverage/
# Embedded prototype repo (separate codebase — not part of the TanStack app)
swap/

/* Playwright's run artefacts (`app/test-results/<test>/
   error-context.md` + `.last-run.json`). Every E2E run rewrites them, so
   `git status` carried a fresh untracked entry after each run - same
   mechanism as `.tanstack/` above. They are run output, not source. */
app/test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
